    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>By invading targets with your psychic presence, you isolate parts of their minds, preventing them from functioning in a coherent manner. Targets who fail their save are @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.8rIj0ewW4bL8Uph5]{Confused} for the duration. Each round, a target rolls twice to determine their behavior due to the @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.8rIj0ewW4bL8Uph5]{Confused} condition, and you choose which result applies.</p>"
    },
